{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"对客户创建的「升级版」商品进行删除操作，可删除的商品为归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的商品，已经关联计划的商品不允许删除，支持批量删除，一次性调用最大个数为100，服务为部分成功部分失败。配合接口：【获取Access token】、【附录-返回码】。\",\"id\":\"dpa.ebp_clue_product.delete\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/v3.0/dpa/ebp/clue_product/delete/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1846200682152971\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get_access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"请求该接口需要通过此接口获取授权access_token\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"appendix_return_code\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710760866831\",\"reason\":\"该接口的应答码和应答信息需要参考此接口文档\",\"relation\":\"配合接口\",\"title\":\"附录-返回码\"}],\"risk_level\":\"high\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1846200682152971\",\"title\":\"删除升级版商品\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZDQ3xKJO\">【使用场景】</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-2FU4092U\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-QZp4ERj9\">可删除的商品为归属升级版巨量引擎工作台的商品（包括导入到升级版巨量引擎工作台的商品）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-fhSEmfaM\">对客户创建的<strong>「升级版」</strong>商品进行删除操作，注意已经关联计划的商品不允许进行删除，支持批量，一次性调用最大个数为100，服务为部分成功部分失败。</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-ziirkBVk\">【支持的删除方式】</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-custom=\"false\" data-id=\"t3945309-A474L9PJ\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"100%\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-Ddd41L1m\"><col data-id=\"c0bb105d-ROPMjPMK\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c0bb105d-GC7o6F4P\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/><col data-id=\"c0bb105d-M7Gjf5Yr\" span=\"1\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"/></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-3AXla54C\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-TaGVO8Np\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-MIAlQkke\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kpJN7sSA\">删除模式</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-GBoXTSr0\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-nZ7wVATM\">支持类目</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-JaIU5obh\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-vOCIjgxM\">类目id（category_id）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-YaBcXM3H\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-0AEqZm2f\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uW36iwdl\">支持按照店铺ID+外部商品ID删除</p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-K35V9fMK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Bb3BhdPg\">电商店铺商品</p></td><td class=\"table-last-row\" data-id=\"t1b895c3-mFIM0JdK\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-mq1vGNcE\">140000000</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-Afnjp8YQ\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-48a114QU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-rvCR5IoC\">按照product_id指定删除</p></td><td class=\"table-last-column\" data-id=\"t1c8f800-9XEJ7AUU\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-MG2Y9pvi\">除电商店铺商品外的商品</p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-83gVMJNC\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-BxKSLx0n\">截止12.9为活动、房产、招商加盟、教育培训、医疗服务、人资代招、岗位招聘</p></blockquote></td><td class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" data-id=\"t16089ba-Yf2dHMX9\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-CMBplIeC\">250000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-i26krnc7\">130000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-jh0myn4c\">240000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-TyztrCVp\">40000000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-WLfm0tS1\">50900000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-DCUz5RTu\">110100000</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-rb3Bl02h\">120000000</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201842136845014016%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-kO4lOHNp\" id=\"h346b9f0-kO4lOHNp\">请求地址</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-37I5ZBQ3\">https://api.oceanengine.com/open_api/v3.0/dpa/ebp/clue_product/delete/<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1846200682152971\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-U7WNr5d2\" id=\"h346b9f0-U7WNr5d2\">请求方法</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-NhOShmo8\">POST</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-JUw0YVt8\" id=\"h346b9f0-JUw0YVt8\">Header</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"header\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Access-Token</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">授权access_token，可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\">获取Access token</a>】接口获取</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">Content-Type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">请求消息类型<br/>允许值: <code>application/json</code></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-2XUVwxnr\" id=\"h346b9f0-2XUVwxnr\">请求参数</h1><section class=\"table api-table\" data-tabletype=\"request\" data-type=\"apitable\"><section class=\"row header\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 250px;\" width=\"250\"><p>字段</p></section><section class=\"col\" style=\"width: 120px;\" width=\"120\"><p>类型</p></section><section class=\"col\"><p>描述</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-hsY3xnqa\">账户ID</p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">account_type</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag primary\">必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-h1D0RoUE\">账户类型 可选值: </p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-VRhaS6OA\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9lDcNiD0\"><code>EBP</code> 升级版巨量引擎工作台</li></ul></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"arrow\" style=\"left: 4px;\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"8\" viewbox=\"0 0 6 8\" width=\"6\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.08156 4.63972C5.50823 4.31972 5.50823 3.67972 5.08156 3.35972L1.88156 0.959719C1.35417 0.564177 0.601563 0.940483 0.601563 1.59972L0.601562 6.39972C0.601562 7.05896 1.35417 7.43526 1.88156 7.03972L5.08156 4.63972Z\" fill=\"#969AA0\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></section><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">store_id_and_outer_id</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>object</p></section><section class=\"col description\">通过店铺ID和商品外部ID删除<p data-id=\"p838747a-QGzJxFqY\"><span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">电商店铺商品（category_id为140000000时）支持按照店铺id+外部商品id删除，其他类目商品不需要传</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">store_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-3TEXXmF2\">店铺ID，<span style=\"background-color: #f8f8f9;\">传入时必须与商品外部ID同时传入</span></p></section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"1\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 32px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">outer_id</p><section class=\"col_params_tag\"><section class=\"param-tag success\">条件必填</section></section></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>string</p></section><section class=\"col description\">商品外部ID</section></section><section class=\"row body\" data-level=\"0\" style=\"display: table-row\"><section class=\"col\" style=\"padding-left: 16px;\"><section class=\"col_params\"><p class=\"col_params_name\">product_ids</p></section></section><section class=\"col col_param_type\"><p>number[]</p></section><section class=\"col description\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZKyHGJgh\">通过商品ID删除</p></section></section></section><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-6aqDhg04\" id=\"h346b9f0-6aqDhg04\">请求示例</h1><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-mulit-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"multicodeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22langs%22%3A%5B%7B%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%23%20coding%3Dutf-8%5Cnimport%20json%5Cnimport%20requests%5Cn%5Cnfrom%20six%20import%20string_types%5Cnfrom%20six.moves.urllib.parse%20import%20urlencode%2C%20urlunparse%20%20%23%20noqa%5Cn%5CnACCESS_TOKEN%20%3D%20%5C%22xxx%5C%22%5CnPATH%20%3D%20%5C%22%2Fopen_api%2Fv3.0%2Fdpa%2Febp%2Fclue_product%2Fdelete%2F%5C%22%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20build_url(path%2C%20query%3D%5C%22%5C%22)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str%2C%20str)%20-%3E%20str%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Build%20request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20path%3A%20Request%20path%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20query%3A%20Querystring%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Request%20URL%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20scheme%2C%20netloc%20%3D%20%5C%22https%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22api.oceanengine.com%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20urlunparse((scheme%2C%20netloc%2C%20path%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22%2C%20query%2C%20%5C%22%5C%22))%5Cn%5Cndef%20post(json_str)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20type%3A%20(str)%20-%3E%20dict%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20Send%20POST%20request%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Aparam%20json_str%3A%20Args%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%3Areturn%3A%20Response%20in%20JSON%20format%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22%5C%22%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%20%20url%20%3D%20build_url(PATH)%5Cn%20%20%20%20args%20%3D%20json.loads(json_str)%5Cn%20%20%20%20headers%20%3D%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%